---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
	<article class="column">
		<div class="Document">
			<h1>About</h1>

			<p>
				I’m a software engineer based in New York City. I thrive at mission-driven companies that highly
				value teamwork, transparency, and communication. The majority of my professional experience has
				been in developing 3rd party integrations, back-end APIs, and front-end UIs for SaaS companies.
				Additionally, I’ve grown to appreciate broader aspects of software engineering, such as people
				management.
			</p>

			<h2>Credits</h2>

			<p>
				Much credit is due to the influences that helped me stitch together a personal website that most
				closely represents me. These are the sources that helped me build this vision:
			</p>

			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="https://github.com/jamesknelson/create-react-blog">create-react-blog</a>: Bootstrapped
					this website
				</li>
				<li><a href="https://www.discogs.com/label/6170-Tempa">Tempa</a>: Inspired my logo</li>
				<li>
					<a href="http://web.mta.info/nyct/service/sevenlin.htm">7 Train</a>: Inspired the color theme of
					my logo and website
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</article>
</Base>

<style>
	.Document h1 {
		margin-top: unset;
		font-family: CrimsonText, Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 900;
		line-height: 1.1;
		text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
		color: #020759;
	}
</style>
